From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 16:34:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Settle interrupted threaded WebSocket handoffs

Freeze hibernatable state during a park attempt. Confirm or fence an interrupted adoption on its WAL open even if the requesting event disconnects. Limit forced session cancellation to definition drains, and require a node-routed upgrade for hibernatable WebSocketPair events.

